    "reviews": "\u201cTechnosphere Reload does a fantastic job of being a memorable platform experience.\u201d<br>4/5 \u2013 TheXboxHub<br><br>\u201cAll this considered, I really think Technosphere Reload is a great blend of genre basics and new ideas.\u201d<br>82% \u2013 Pixel Pop Network<br><br>\u201cAccelerated or not, I really enjoyed rolling around with the technosphere in TECHNOSPHERE RELOAD.\u201d<br>84% \u2013 Christcentered Gamer<br>",
